task_id: search_0032
task_type: search
instruction: "The directory kb/ contains a small knowledge base: files of different kinds (markdown, csv, json, log, plain text) in several subdirectories, and some files are hidden. Which sku has the smallest stock in the product list? Use the file tools or bash (ls, grep, cat, awk, python3) to find it. Work only inside the current directory. When you are done, write ONLY the final answer to the file answer.txt in the current directory (for example with bash: echo 42 > answer.txt)."
reward: 5
expected: N-120
check: exact_str